        "text_free": "如果要讲到画家，我们经常呢就会用一些赞美之词来形容。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.565,
      "end": 8.3,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "你比如讲啊，妙笔生花呀，",
      "score": 0.1345,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1431,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.083,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "你比如讲啊，描笔生发呀。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.3,
      "end": 12.459,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "啊，画龙点睛啊，还有这个沉竹再雄啊等等。",
      "score": 0.0855,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0946,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.009,
        "seg_cer": 0.176,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "啊，画龙点睛啊，还有这个沉住战熊啊，等等。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 12.731,
      "end": 16.801,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "但是在我们桂林灵川县有一位特殊的画家，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0745,
